{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"厄立特里亚","country_iso":"ERI","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:27:39.261082","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ERI-HB-0001","ldc":"Yes","location":"德克姆哈雷地区","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"厄立特里亚国德克姆哈雷地区30兆瓦光伏储能项目","project_name_en":"Eritrea Dekemhare 30MW PV + 15MW/30MWh BESS Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"山西电建","content":"当地时间2月28日，中国能建首个厄立特里亚国光伏储能项目——厄立特里亚国德克姆哈雷地区30兆瓦光伏储能项目总承包项目举行签约仪式。中国能建成为首个进入厄立特里亚国的中央企业。\n项目建设容量为30兆瓦光伏电站+15兆瓦/30兆瓦时储能系统，以及接入对端约750米的66千伏架空输电线路。项目建成后，将有效改善当地电力供应、降低电力成本，促进能源资源多样化，为厄立特里亚国及首都阿斯马拉电网能力注入绿色动能。\n项目的成功签约是中国能建山西电建推进国际业务板块“走出去”战略的积极落地。中国能建山西电建以增强核心功能、提高核心竞争力为重点，踔厉奋发开拓国际海外市场，坚定筑牢新能源业务主阵地，为系统打造高质量发展的“三新”能建，加快建设集团一流企业贡献力量。","content_sha256":"2369b3c2df8bfa2c1177a793b1a3f79cca21455a59740eb5ab6be98e4e50efca","id":9320,"publish_date":"2024-03-02 18:59:02","title":"中国能建首个厄立特里亚国光伏储能项目签约","title_sha256":"db735448224411d24ff9f9be5ed2ad4a01974281f45571a5c80559abe9f0e66d","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/61221.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ERI-HB-0001","capacity_details":"PV: 30MW, BESS: 15MW/30MWh","capacity_mw":45.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"45","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:27:39.261535","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ERI-HB-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.powerchina.cn/col/col7449/art/2025/art_1346031749.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"中能建国际建设集团有限公司","project_developer_en":"China Energy Engineering Group International Construction Co., Ltd.","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国能建山西电建在厄立特里亚国签约承建了德克姆哈雷地区30兆瓦光伏储能项目。该项目包括30兆瓦光伏电站和15兆瓦/30兆瓦时储能系统，旨在改善当地电力供应。项目处于签约阶段。","publish_date":"2024-03-02 18:59:02","pv_capacity_mw":30.0,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/61221.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":30.0,"storage_power_mw":15.0,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}},{"articles":[{"author":"山西电建","content":"1月24日，中国能建山西电建中标非洲厄立特里亚国德克姆哈雷地区30兆瓦光伏储能项目。\n该项目建设包括30兆瓦光伏电站，15兆瓦/30兆瓦时储能系统，以及接入对端约750米的66千伏架空输电线路。项目建成后，首年并网电量约7000余万度，将有效改善当地用电难的状况，对当地改善生态环境有着显著意义。","content_sha256":"f27c239b31ed1fd2b9f67de449f6247d2dc8aeaeb091d056d37948acfcb329b9","id":9702,"publish_date":"2024-02-01 21:32:02","title":"中国能建山西电建中标非洲厄立特里亚国光伏储能项目","title_sha256":"5c56e9f83db97f2b8aaf2b419afdc011abb9ffe38e9f264259f3b1be86a16651","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/59545.html"},{"author":"能建国际","content":"近日，中国能建国际集团收到厄立特里亚德克姆哈雷30MW光伏储能项目中标通知书，实现了新国别新突破。\n厄立特里亚位于非洲东北部，西邻苏丹共和国，南邻埃塞俄比亚、吉布提，东隔红海与沙特阿拉伯和也门相望，扼红海进出印度洋的门户。该项目位于厄立特里亚首都阿斯马拉以南40公里德克姆哈雷镇，工程内容包括新建装机30MW光伏电站和15MW/30MWh储能电站以及接入变电站的约750米的架空输电线路。项目资金来源于非开行贷款，业主为厄立特里能矿部。","content_sha256":"1cb985ebd79bf4515ccfdf428effc20d5697b1ec648e0e84e2fa2de3e9c1d1ec","id":9790,"publish_date":"2024-01-27 09:42:07","title":"新国别！厄立特里亚德克姆哈雷30MW光伏储能项目中标","title_sha256":"8dd903f2967571035976fc494ccbf13475223ee73d407b4aa6581d203c78c8e7","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/59042.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"【合并冲突】project_developer:[Unknown vs 厄立特能矿部]→厄立特能矿部; financing_model:[Unknown vs 信贷融资]→Unknown","canonical_id":"ERI-HB-0001","capacity_details":"PV: 30MW, BESS: 15MW/30MWh","capacity_mw":30.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"30","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:29:15.790963","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ERI-HB-0001-02","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://guangfu.bjx.com.cn/news/20240304/1363995.shtml\"]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/2024/3/2/art_11019_2530696.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"厄立特能矿部","project_developer_en":"Eritrea Ministry of Energy and Mines","project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"中国能建山西电建中标厄立特里亚国德克姆哈雷地区30兆瓦光伏储能项目。该项目包括30兆瓦光伏电站和15兆瓦/30兆瓦时储能系统，旨在改善当地用电状况和生态环境。","publish_date":"2024-02-01 21:32:02","pv_capacity_mw":30.0,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/59545.html\", \"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/59042.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":30.0,"storage_power_mw":15.0,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}},{"articles":[{"author":"山西电建","content":"当地时间6月15日，由中国能建山西电建承建的厄立特里亚最大光伏储能电站德克姆哈雷30兆瓦光伏储能项目，圆满完成运营移交。\n项目位于厄立特里亚首都阿斯马拉以南的德克姆哈雷镇，为该国当前装机规模最大的光伏电站。该项目既是中厄共建“一带一路”、深化能源领域务实合作的标志性工程，也是山西电建落地厄立特里亚市场的首个新能源项目。\n项目建设容量为30兆瓦光伏电站(含15/66千伏升压站)+15兆瓦/30兆瓦时储能系统，以及接入对端约750米的66千伏架空输电线路。","content_sha256":"7925cffa44e091cf5febdd0c3068fb4bf8ebdcc4aa1838f3472588070526a108","id":26919,"publish_date":"2026-06-18 21:07:01","title":"圆满完成移交！厄立特里亚最大光伏储能电站德克姆哈雷30兆瓦光伏储能项目","title_sha256":"468b23b38b8fecb2ae87d4db9193550e76ac88c0f2be7b1a8965d9494cc31d9f","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/95782.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ERI-HB-0001","capacity_details":"PV: 30MW, BESS: 15MW","capacity_mw":45.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"45.0","capacity_source":"original","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-07-02T13:17:3